**/.idea
**/.terraform
**/.DS_Store
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan
/codepacks/

# Private keys must never be committed. The CloudFront signing key belongs in SSM as a
# SecureString; only the public half under keys/ is tracked. Belt and braces — the
# bootstrap in keys/README.md generates outside the working tree in the first place.
*.pem
!keys/*.pub.pem

